        {
            "_id": "d0G0HAlwNnd9yTlp",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg",
            "name": "Blinking Strobe",
            "sort": 700000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The node's gem coruscates with light. Enemies within a @Template[type:emanation|distance:30] must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:37|options:area-effect,inflicts:dazzled,inflicts:blinded] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Blinded] for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the target is teleported to a space of the node's choice within 30 feet that the node can see.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": [
                        "concentrate",
                        "light",
                        "primal",
                        "teleportation"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        },
        {
            "_id": "z8dytJqIf1YulmB3",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg",
            "name": "Hardlight Projection",
            "sort": 800000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The node projects a new Small or Medium humanoid form around itself, changing its appearance but not its statistics. The node's projected form is a solid body made of hardlight. While using a projected form, the node's true form, a Tiny gem, is always visible somewhere on the projection, such as set into a piece of jewelry. The gemstone is the facetal's sensory organ, and if the gemstone is covered, the facetal node is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Blinded].</p>"
                },
